re are you from? So many people have been passing through lately.","zh":"你好啊，从哪儿来的？这阵子过路的人真多。"}},{"key":"default","text":{"en":"Those who come to pray these days ask for longer days and quiet nights. I tell them what the Church teaches: suffering brings us closer to God.","zh":"近来来祷告的人，求的多是白昼长些、夜里平安。我便照教会的教导告诉他们：苦难使人接近神。"}},{"key":"hour:morning","text":{"en":"Morning prayers are just over. If you want holy water, you will have to wait for the deacon; he has the key.","zh":"晨祷刚做完。你若要领圣水，得等执事回来，钥匙在他身上。"}},{"key":"weather:storm","text":{"en":"Storm off the sea. Stack the wood high and keep the shutters shut.","zh":"海上起风暴了。柴堆高，窗板关好。"}}]}}},{"type":"item/light/candle","id":"frostfang.brierbrook-shrine.folk0.s0.0","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"frostfang.brierbrook-shrine.folk0"}},{"type":"item/light/candle","id":"frostfang.brierbrook-shrine.folk0.s0.1","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"frostfang.brierbrook-shrine.folk0"}},{"type":"item/light/candle","id":"frostfang.brierbrook-shrine.folk0.s0.2","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"frostfang.brierbrook-shrine.folk0"}},{"type":"item/vessel/flask/holy_water","id":"frostfang.brierbrook-shrine.folk0.s1.0","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"frostfang.brierbrook-shrine.folk0"}},{"id":"frostfang.brierbrook-shrine.folk0.coin0","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"frostfang.brierbrook-shrine.folk0"}},{"id":"frostfang.brierbrook-shrine.folk0.coin1","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"frostfang.brierbrook-shrine.folk0"}},{"id":"frostfang.brierbrook-shrine.folk1","type":"actor/person/traveler","name":{"en":"Liv Gullwell","zh":"莉芙·鸥井"},"place":{"on":"tile","map":"frostfang.brierbrook-shrine","x":17,"y":8},"facing":"down","props":{"age":43,"household":"frostfang.brierbrook-shrine.h0","purse":5,"favourite":"item/light/lantern"},"contents":["frostfang.brierbrook-shrine.folk1.coin0","frostfang.brierbrook-shrine.folk1.coin1","frostfang.brierbrook-shrine.folk1.coin2","frostfang.brierbrook-shrine.folk1.coin3","frostfang.brierbrook-shrine.folk1.coin4"],"look":{"body":"woman","parts":{"hair":"hair.braid","face":"face.weary","outfit":"outfit.cloak","legs":"legs.hose","shoes":"shoes.boots"},"colors":{"skin":"fair","hair":"umber","eyes":"leaf","outfit.1":"charcoal","legs.1":"linen","shoes.1":"umber"}},"npc":{"role":"traveler","schedule":[{"from":22,"to":6,"map":"frostfang.brierbrook-shrine","x":14,"y":11,"activity":"sleep"},{"from":6,"to":12,"map":"frostfang.brierbrook-shrine","x":17,"y":8,"activity":"work"},{"from":12,"to":13,"map":"frostfang.brierbrook-shrine","x":14,"y":11,"activity":"eat","tends":["hungry"]},{"from":13,"to":18,"map":"frostfang.brierbrook-shrine","x":17,"y":8,"activity":"work"},{"from":18,"to":22,"map":"frostfang.brierbrook-shrine","x":14,"y":11,"activity":"rest"}],"fidelity":"local","person":{"lines":[{"key":"greeting:first","text":{"en":"Hello there. Where are you from? So many people have been passing through lately.","zh":"你好啊，从哪儿来的？这阵子过路的人真多。"}},{"key":"default","text":{"en":"The Church named me for the pilgrimage. They say it is calling people everywhere; of every ten I meet on the road, three or four are on the same errand.","zh":"教会点了我的名，叫我去朝圣。听说各地都在召人，路上碰见的十个人里，倒有三四个跟我一样。"}},{"key":"default","text":{"en":"They say there's a knight on the road past Vesper Ford who stops everyone. Nobody gets by him.","zh":"听说过了晚祷渡的那条大路上，有个骑士把路拦住了，谁也过不去。"}}]}}},{"id":"frostfang.brierbrook-shrine.folk1.coin0","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"frostfang.brierbrook-shrine.folk1"}},{"id":"frostfang.brierbrook-shrine.folk1.coin1","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"frostfang.brierbrook-shrine.folk1"}},{"id":"frostfang.brierbrook-shrine.folk1.coin2","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"frostfang.brierbrook-shrine.folk1"}},{"id":"frostfang.brierbrook-shrine.folk1.coin3","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"frostfang.brierbrook-shrine.folk1"}},{"id":"frostfang.brierbrook-shrine.folk1.coin4","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"frostfang.brierbrook-shrine.folk1"}},{"id":"frostfang.brierbrook-shrine.folk2","type":"actor/person/traveler","name":{"en":"Ylva Gullwell","zh":"伊尔娃·鸥井"},"place":{"on":"tile","map":"frostfang.brierbrook-shrine","x":10,"y":8},"facing":"down","props":{"age":38,"household":"frostfang.brierbrook-shrine.h0","purse":6,"favourite":"item/food/wine"},"contents":["frostfang.brierbrook-shrine.folk2.coin0","frostfang.brierbrook-shrine.folk2.coin1","frostfang.brierbrook-shrine.folk2.coin2","frostfang.brierbrook-shrine.folk2.coin3","frostfang.brierbrook-shrine.folk2.coin4","frostfang.brierbrook-shrine.folk2.coin5"],"look":{"body":"woman","parts":{"hair":"hair.wavy","face":"face.soft","outfit":"outfit.cloak","shoes":"shoes.boots"},"colors":{"skin":"brown","hair":"copper","eyes":"bark","outfit.1":"umber","shoes.1":"umber"}},"npc":{"role":"traveler","schedule":[{"from":21,"to":6,"map":"frostfang.brierbrook-shrine","x":13,"y":8,"activity":"sleep"},{"from":6,"to":12,"map":"frostfang.brierbrook-shrine","x":10,"y":8,"activity":"work"},{"from":12,"to":13,"map":"frostfang.brierbrook-shrine","x":13,"y":8,"activity":"eat","tends":["hungry"]},{"from":13,"to":18,"map":"frostfang.brierbrook-shrine","x":10,"y":8,"activity":"work"},{"from":18,"to":21,"map":"frostfang.brierbrook-shrine","x":16,"y":11,"activity":"rest"}],"fidelity":"local","person":{"lines":[{"key":"greeting:first","text":{"en":"Oh, hello. Can I help you?","zh":"啊，你好。找我有事吗？"}},{"key":"default","text":{"en":"Six days on the road to get here, and I've worn through my soles. Is there a cobbler round here?","zh":"我走了六天才到这儿，鞋底都磨穿了。这附近有补鞋的吗？"}},{"key":"default","text":{"en":"The Church named me for the pilgrimage. They say it is calling people everywhere; of every ten I meet on the road, three or four are on the same errand.","zh":"教会点了我的名，叫我去朝圣。听说各地都在召人，路上碰见的十个人里，倒有三四个跟我一样。"}},{"key":"weather:storm","text":{"en":"Storm off the sea. Stack the wood high and keep the shutters shut.","zh":"海上起风暴了。柴堆高，窗板关好。"}}]}}},{"id":"frostfang.brierbrook-shrine.folk2.coin0","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"frostfang.brierbrook-shrine.folk2"}},{"id":"frostfang.brierbrook-shrine.folk2.coin1","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"frostfang.brierbrook-shrine.folk2"}},{"id":"frostfang.brierbrook-shrine.folk2.coin2","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"frostfang.brierbrook-shrine.folk2"}},{"id":"frostfang.brierbrook-shrine.folk2.coin3","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"frostfang.brierbrook-shrine.folk2"}},{"id":"frostfang.brierbrook-shrine.folk2.coin4","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"frostfang.brierbrook-shrine.folk2"}},{"id":"frostfang.brierbrook-shrine.folk2.coin5","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"frostfang.brierbrook-shrine.folk2"}}]}